Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Order enabling changes, migrations, and cleanup using exact dependency and capacity services. Preserve ongoing delivery constraints, identify irreversible steps, and create milestones that deliver useful improvements before the entire campaign is complete.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
